{
  "note": "Wave D lane swing_desk (lanes/swing/desk.rs): the /swing page and its JSON on the bed's real sw_ rows at several clocks, the refusals of every order-shaped route (422/400/404/409), the reconcile and the 10:45 sweep with nothing SENT, and SW15's scan button (200, then 409 in flight, then 429 inside a minute). DRY_RUN=true throughout; the replay Kite must record no order or GTT call. The day's risk_ledger row is written by both desks when the swing gateway is first built (app.main.gateway() builds _risk); its updated_at is the server's now(), so it is masked. The HTML pages differ only in base.html's F&O nav badge until the fno lane registers fno_badge. Review (adversarial pass): the 4 Sep 09:30 cases run a real DRY_RUN confirm on the bed's own lines; sw_fill.created_at, sw_plan_line.updated_at and sw_position.created_at/updated_at are server now()/CURRENT_TIMESTAMP stamps (the injected clock cannot reach the database), masked as <null>/<set> like risk_ledger.updated_at.",
